# Secrets for the APRS.NET services. install.sh makes this file readable by root only; systemd reads it before
# starting each aprsnet-serve@ service, so the values reach aprscli without being in a config file or the process
# list. aprscli never prints or logs them.

# The APRS-IS passcode for an IGate's callsign (aprscli passcode N0CALL-10), for igate = true:
# APRS_PASSCODE=
